OL,3,GNEWSANature GCSE backers want more
OL,4,A'greenlightenment'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNaturalist Steve Backshall and Lost
OL,7,FGardens of Heligan co-founder Sir Tim
OL,8,FSmit have called for more
OL,9,F"greenlightenment" to put nature
OL,10,Feducation at the heart of school
OL,11,Fcurriculums.
OL,13,FIt comes as the government has been
OL,14,Fconsulting on a new natural history
OL,15,FGCSE, which Sir Tim said was a "seismic
OL,16,Fmoment for British education", adding
OL,17,F"a deep understanding of the natural
OL,18,Fworld is fundamental to humanity's
OL,19,Ffuture".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
