OL,3,GNEWSANature GCSE backers want more
OL,4,A'greenlightenment'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBackshall, who hosted the Wild Heligan
OL,7,Fexperience to excite young people about
OL,8,Fwildlife, said: "I see every day how
OL,9,Fnature revitalises, restores and fills
OL,10,Fpeople with joy."
OL,12,FA survey by Heligan of 1,004 parent and
OL,13,Fchild groups across England found 55%
OL,14,Fof children had never climbed a tree.
